---
export const prerender = true;
import Shop from '@/layouts/Shop.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '@/components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { tenant } from '@/config/tenant';
---

<Shop
  title={`Terms of Service | ${tenant.name}`}
  description={`Terms and conditions for using ${tenant.name}, an EU-based nicotine pouch shop.`}
  canonical="/terms"
>
  <section class="bg-background text-foreground">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
      <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none
        prose-headings:text-foreground prose-p:text-muted-foreground
        prose-a:text-primary prose-strong:text-foreground
        prose-li:text-muted-foreground prose-hr:border-border">

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-8">Effective date: 31 March 2026</p>

        <h2>1. About Us</h2>
        <p>
          {tenant.name} is operated by SnusFriend ("we", "us", or "our"), registered in Sweden.
          Our website is located at {tenant.domain} ("Site"). For questions about these Terms,
          contact us at <a href={`mailto:${tenant.supportEmail}`}>{tenant.supportEmail}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>2. General Terms</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the Site and all related services,
          including ordering, account management, and community features. By accessing or using
          the Site, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, you must not use
          the Site.
        </p>
        <p>
          {tenant.name} reserves the right to update these Terms at any time. Changes will be
          posted on this page with an updated effective date. Changes become effective upon
          your next order or continued use of the Site after the update.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Eligibility and Age Verification</h2>
        <p>
          You must be at least <strong>18 years of age</strong> (or the legal age for purchasing
          nicotine products in your jurisdiction, whichever is higher) to use the Site and place
          orders. By creating an account or placing an order, you confirm that you meet this age
          requirement.
        </p>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to request proof of age at any time and to cancel orders where
          age verification cannot be completed. Any attempt to purchase products while underage
          may be reported to the relevant authorities.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Orders</h2>
        <p>
          An order is considered confirmed once you receive an order confirmation email from us.
          We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order for reasons including but not limited
          to: product availability, pricing errors, suspected fraud, or failure to meet eligibility
          requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are only obligated to deliver products that are available in our inventory at the
          time of dispatch. If a product becomes unavailable after you place your order, we will
          notify you and offer a full refund for the unavailable item.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Prices, Fees, and Payment</h2>
        <p>
          All prices on the Site are displayed in euros ({tenant.currencyCode}). Prices may
          exclude local VAT or excise taxes depending on your country of delivery; any applicable
          taxes are calculated and shown at checkout before you complete your order.
        </p>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to adjust prices at any time. Price changes will not affect
          orders that have already been confirmed.
        </p>
        <p>
          Payment is processed securely through our payment provider (Nyehandel) at checkout.
          Accepted payment methods include credit/debit cards and other methods available at
          checkout. We do not store your full payment card details on our servers.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Shipping and Delivery</h2>
        <p>
          We ship to countries within the European Union. Delivery times are estimates and
          may vary depending on your location and carrier conditions. Typical delivery is
          2&ndash;5 business days after dispatch.
        </p>
        <p>
          Free shipping is available on orders over &euro;{tenant.freeShippingThreshold}.
          Shipping costs for orders below this threshold are calculated and displayed at checkout.
        </p>
        <p>
          Risk of loss and title for products pass to you upon delivery. If your package arrives
          damaged, please report it within <strong>2 business days</strong> of receipt. For
          concealed damage (damage discovered after opening), report within <strong>7 business
          days</strong>. For packages lost in transit, contact us within 14 days of the expected
          delivery date.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Returns and Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          Under EU consumer law, you have a <strong>14-day right of withdrawal</strong> from the
          date you receive your order. Due to the nature of nicotine products and health
          regulations, we can only accept returns of <strong>unopened, undamaged products in
          their original sealed packaging</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          To initiate a return, contact our support team at
          <a href={`mailto:${tenant.supportEmail}`}>{tenant.supportEmail}</a>.
          The customer is responsible for return shipping costs unless we shipped the wrong
          product or the product arrived damaged.
        </p>
        <p>
          Refunds will be processed to your original payment method within <strong>14 days</strong>
          of receiving the returned product. The original standard delivery cost is refunded;
          however, if you chose an express or premium shipping option, the difference between
          standard and premium shipping is not refunded.
        </p>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to refuse returns that do not meet these conditions, show signs
          of tampering, or have broken seals.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Discount Codes and Promotions</h2>
        <p>
          Discount codes are single-use per order unless otherwise stated. Minimum order values
          may apply. Discount codes cannot be exchanged for cash, combined with other offers
          (unless explicitly permitted), or applied retroactively to existing orders. We reserve
          the right to invalidate codes that are distributed or used in ways that violate these
          Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on the Site &mdash; including text, graphics, logos, images, product
          descriptions, and software &mdash; is the property of {tenant.name} or its licensors
          and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from any
          content on the Site without prior written permission. Product names and brand logos
          belong to their respective owners.
        </p>

        <h2>10. User Accounts and Conduct</h2>
        <p>
          You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials
          and for all activity that occurs under your account. You agree to notify us
          immediately of any unauthorized access.
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree not to: use the Site for any unlawful purpose; submit false or misleading
          information; attempt to interfere with the Site's operation; resell products purchased
          on the Site without authorization; or post abusive, offensive, or harmful content in
          community features.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, {tenant.name} shall not be liable for any
          indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of
          profits, revenues, or data, whether incurred directly or indirectly, arising from
          your use of the Site or products purchased through it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our total liability for any claim arising from these Terms or your use of the Site
          shall not exceed the amount you paid for the specific order giving rise to the claim.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Force Majeure</h2>
        <p>
          {tenant.name} is not liable for delays or failure to perform any obligation under these
          Terms where the delay or failure results from causes beyond our reasonable control,
          including but not limited to: natural disasters, war, terrorism, labour disputes,
          government actions, supply chain disruptions, carrier delays, pandemics, or
          interruption of transportation or telecommunications infrastructure.
        </p>

        <h2>13. Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Sweden.
          Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Site shall be resolved
          through the courts of Sweden, without prejudice to any mandatory consumer protection
          provisions in your country of residence that may apply.
        </p>
        <p>
          For EU consumers: you may also use the European Commission's Online Dispute Resolution
          platform at <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>14. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at
          <a href={`mailto:${tenant.supportEmail}`}>{tenant.supportEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Shop>
